{"3418720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "禁地直播", "steam_appid": 3418720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/7f560509aedf061b37738859807ca334.poster.avif?t=1774858698\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/7f560509aedf061b37738859807ca334.webm?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/7f560509aedf061b37738859807ca334.mp4?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist Li Feng had frequent nightmares after his parents passed away in an amusement park accident ten years ago, and unexpectedly received a &quot;invitation letter from the other side&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/7ea2912593f1b851d649c8b78ace3af8.poster.avif?t=1774858698\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/7ea2912593f1b851d649c8b78ace3af8.webm?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/7ea2912593f1b851d649c8b78ace3af8.mp4?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spirit exploration live streaming event at an abandoned amusement park. In order to prevent others from profiting from his parents' tragedy and uncover the truth behind the accident, Li Feng participated in activities and met paranormal anchor Zhang Huohuo, masked anchor Yi Jin, Xia Guo, journalist Wu Fei, and anti-counterfeiting blogger Yuan Zhi.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/26300f6726b736c78864b88361dabd16.poster.avif?t=1774858698\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/26300f6726b736c78864b88361dabd16.webm?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/26300f6726b736c78864b88361dabd16.mp4?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay of the game is &quot;branch selection+puzzle solving+clue collection&quot;.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/19cf2e3859d35d77a5e44267ef7e0a3e.poster.avif?t=1774858698\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/19cf2e3859d35d77a5e44267ef7e0a3e.webm?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/19cf2e3859d35d77a5e44267ef7e0a3e.mp4?t=1774858698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to solve puzzles in scenes such as Ferris wheels, carousels, haunted houses, etc. through password unlocking, item combinations, QTE reactions, and other small games, and collect clues such as diaries, insurance policies, and audio tapes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418720/extras/834ef2157535a8fd0fce1082388a1f6c.poster.avif?t=1774858698\" width=854 height=480 